ges":[{"pos":53402,"endPos":61333,"startLine":974,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":1113,"endLineOffset":5,"length":7932}]}]},{"comment":"The `tierFieldTermQueryCoordinatorRewriteIfPresent` method and its usages assume that the `tierFieldType.internalTermQueryCaseInsensitive`, `prefixQuery`, `wildcardQuery`, etc., methods will always return either a `MatchAllDocsQuery` or a `MatchNoDocsQuery`. This assumption is not explicitly documented in the code, and there\u0027s no assertion or check to ensure this behavior. If any of these methods were to return a different type of query in the future, it could lead to unexpected behavior or runtime errors.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/MatchQueryBuilder.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/MatchQueryBuilder.java--14882:15119","promptId":"#H8KE0","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/MatchQueryBuilder.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/MatchQueryBuilder.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":14882,"endPos":15119,"startLine":388,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":391,"endLineOffset":5,"length":238}]},{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryStringQueryBuilder.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryStringQueryBuilder.java--42578:43227","promptId":"#H9T2D","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryStringQueryBuilder.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryStringQueryBuilder.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":42578,"endPos":43227,"startLine":972,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":986,"endLineOffset":5,"length":650}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/core/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/cluster/routing/allocation/mapper/DataTierFieldMapper.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DataTierFieldMapper.java-3164:3171-3244:3253,3337:3613","promptId":"#NF5ZV","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/core/src/main/java/org/elasticsea